# agent-quality-rubric

The Platinum/Gold/Silver/Bronze tier rubric for agent prompts. Composite
score blends static structure, optional LLM judge, and Monte-Carlo
consistency placeholder. Bronze tier auto-flags an agent for anti-rot
review.

## When to Invoke

- `/hm:monitor` agent-quality drill-down panel
- After modifying any `agents/*.md` file (CI hook can run this skill)
- Periodic anti-rot sweep to detect prompt rot

## Tier Thresholds

| Composite | Tier | Action |
|---|---|---|
| ≥ 90 | Platinum | None — exemplar |
| ≥ 80 | Gold | None — healthy |
| ≥ 70 | Silver | Watch — log to `.claude/observability/agent-quality.jsonl` |
| < 70 | Bronze | **Auto-register anti-rot patch candidate** (see below) |

## Implementation

```python
from pathlib import Path
from harness_maker.agent_quality import score_agent

result = score_agent(Path(".claude/agents/code-reviewer.md"))
# {
#   "static": 70, "llm": null, "monte_carlo": 100,
#   "composite": 70, "tier": "Silver"
# }
```

Optional `LLMJudge` protocol for full 3-component scoring:

```python
from harness_maker.agent_quality import score_agent, LLMJudge

class MyJudge(LLMJudge):
    def judge(self, prompt: str) -> int:
        # Call LLM, return 0-100 quality score.
        return 85

result = score_agent(Path(".claude/agents/code-reviewer.md"), judge=MyJudge())
```

## Static Scoring Components

The static score (no LLM call) sums:

- 40 pts — line count 100-500 (just right); 20 pts for 50-99 or 501-700
- 30 pts — has YAML frontmatter (`---` open + close)
- 30 pts — has bullets or fenced code blocks (structured prose)

Capped at 100. Pure function over the file text.

## Bronze Auto-Registration

When `tier == "Bronze"`, this skill writes an anti-rot patch candidate:

```jsonl
{"agent": "code-reviewer.md", "tier": "Bronze", "composite": 65,
 "static": 65, "action": "needs_refresh", "registered_at": "<ISO>"}
```

Append to `.claude/observability/refresh/raw-<date>.jsonl`. The
`relevance-filter` skill picks it up on the next `/hm:refresh` cycle and
proposes a refresh patch (always with manual confirm — never auto-apply).

## Output

The `score_agent(...)` dict, plus a side-effect when Bronze: the
auto-registered candidate line. Consumers (dashboard, refresh) read both.

